shape: sequence_diagram

mac: "Mac\nnavegador"
thinkpad: "ThinkPad\nPortal Chat"
atlas: "Bastion\nAtlas :4001"
navigator: "Bastion\nNavigator :4010"
providers: "Peers\nStar / OCR / KB / RAG"

mac -> thinkpad: GET HTTPS :8443
thinkpad -> mac: HTML, JS y configuración de bootstrap
mac -> atlas: TLS/WSS bootstrap
atlas -> mac: Beacon y acceso al swarm
atlas -> providers: discovery DHT/GossipSub
providers -> atlas: NodeAdvertise firmado
mac -> navigator: resolver Beacon y abrir stream FHS
navigator -> mac: handshake y Pulse
navigator -> providers: capacidades disponibles
providers -> navigator: Beacons verificados
